port databases/vchord
type port
reason "DragonFly: leave out the AVX-512 FP16 shim (dragonfly/@<line> patches)"

# AVX-512 is unsupported on DragonFly. The simd crate's C shim
# (cshim/x86_64_fp16.c) is AVX-512 FP16, which base binutils 2.34 cannot
# assemble either. The patches skip it in build.rs and drop its v4:avx512fp16
# multiversion entries; the remaining v4 (AVX-512) variants are runtime
# dispatched only when the OS enables AVX-512, which DragonFly never does.
